---
layout: "base.njk"
permalink: "/contact/"
title: "Start a project — SciStitch"
description: "Tell SciStitch about your statistics, scientific computing, data analysis, or open-source software project and learn what to include in a first inquiry."
ogTitle: "Start a project — SciStitch"
ogDescription: "Have a data, research, or scientific software challenge? Start a conversation with SciStitch."
---
<section class="inquiry-page section-pad" aria-labelledby="inquiry-title">
  <div class="container inquiry-grid">
    <div class="inquiry-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow section-label"><span>01 /</span> Start a project</p>
      <h1 id="inquiry-title">Tell us the challenge.<br /><span>Let's find a path.</span></h1>
      <p class="inquiry-lead">
        Need help with statistical analysis, scientific computing, or research
        software? Share what you're working on. You don't need a formal brief
        or finalized requirements to start a conversation.
      </p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ site.inquiryMailto }}">
        Email SciStitch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="email-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="inquiry-brief" aria-labelledby="inquiry-brief-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">A useful first message</p>
      <h2 id="inquiry-brief-title">Help us understand your project.</h2>
      <ol class="inquiry-steps">
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>The challenge</h3>
            <p>What question, problem, or goal would you like to address?</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Current context</h3>
            <p>Tell us about your organization, available data, methods,
              existing software, or relevant public links.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="eyebrow" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Practical constraints</h3>
            <p>If known, share your timeline, preferred deliverables,
              and approximate budget. These can be discussed later.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="inquiry-privacy">
        Please avoid sending confidential, sensitive, or personal datasets
        in your first email. We can discuss appropriate ways to share data
        if a project moves forward.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container inquiry-next">
    <p class="eyebrow">What happens next</p>
    <p>
      We can discuss fit, scope, availability, and an appropriate next step.
      Any project proposal and contracting arrangement would be agreed separately
      before work begins.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
